cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this mapping, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "OWASP-AISVS-v1.01-to-CSF-v2.0"
abstract: >-
  Supportive relationship mapping (NIST IR 8477) of the NIST Cybersecurity
  Framework (CSF) 2.0 Core to the requirements of the OWASP Artificial
  Intelligence Security Verification Standard (AISVS) v1.01, prepared with the
  NIST OLIR template for CSF 2.0. Screened by NIST for the National Online
  Informative References (OLIR) Program. Independent work, not an official
  OWASP mapping.
